 "summary": "Seven 1 A glass-passivated fast recovery rectifier diodes in the flat-lead SOD-123FL surface-mount package, rated from 50 V (FR101W) to 1000 V (FR107W) repetitive peak reverse voltage. Forward drop is 1.3 V max at 1 A and reverse recovery time is 150 ns, 250 ns or 500 ns max depending on voltage grade. Applications: fast-switching rectification and freewheeling in power supplies, inverters and converters for consumer and telecom equipment. FR107W is the 1000 V, 500 ns type, marked F7.",
